---
import { site } from '../data/site';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<section class="access section-space" id="access" aria-labelledby="access-heading"><div class="container">
  <div class="section-intro" data-reveal><p class="eyebrow">BASED IN SAKURA, HERE FOR YOU.</p><span class="section-index">06 / ACCESS</span></div>
  <div class="access__layout"><div class="access__copy" data-reveal><h2 id="access-heading">佐倉から、<br />暮らしのお手伝い。</h2><p>お手頃な家具・家電と、<br />運ぶ・設置するサポートを。<br />買うときも売るときも、ご相談ください。</p><div class="access__area"><Icon name="truck" size={28} /><span>配送・出張買取<strong>関東エリア対応</strong></span></div><a class="text-link" href={site.facebook} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="facebook-icon" aria-hidden="true">f</span>Facebookを見る<Icon name="diagonal" size={20} /></a></div>
  <div class="access__details" data-reveal><h3>{site.name}</h3><dl><div><dt>所在地</dt><dd>{site.address}<a href={site.map} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="access__map">Googleマップで見る<Icon name="diagonal" size={16} /></a></dd></div><div><dt>電話番号</dt><dd><a href={site.phoneHref} class="access__phone">{site.phone}</a></dd></div><div><dt>営業時間</dt><dd>{site.businessHours}</dd></div><div><dt>定休日</dt><dd>{site.closed}</dd></div><div><dt>駐車場</dt><dd>{site.parking}</dd></div><div><dt>対応エリア</dt><dd>{site.area}（配送・出張買取）</dd></div><div><dt>古物商許可番号</dt><dd class="license-number">{site.license}</dd></div></dl><p class="access__notice"><Icon name="clock" size={19} />ご来店前に、お電話で営業状況をご確認ください。</p></div></div>
</div></section>
